      "content": "\"one small step\" ... that's what people always say, isn't it? it's such a platitude. it doesn't change the fact that there's nothing left to step toward. the social death is complete. i've seen it before in my industry—once you're radioactive like this, you're just done. there is no \"next chapter\" for someone like me. i'm just a ghost walking around.",
